Page 31-after line 3 Insert and renumber as necessary:
"Section 3. There is appropriated five hundred thousand dollars
($500,000.00) from the general fund to the department of revenue for purposes
of information technology programming services and software necessary to
automate payment of universal service fund charges for prepaid wireless service.
This appropriation shall be for the period beginning with the effective date of
this section and ending June 30, 2026. This appropriation shall not be
transferred or expended for any other purpose and any unexpended, unobligated
funds remaining from the appropriation shall revert as provided by law on June
30, 2026. It is the intent of the legislature that this appropriation not be

included in the standard budget of the department of revenue for the immediately
succeeding fiscal biennium.".
