Page 1-line 9 After "provisions;" insert "requiring reporting;".
Page 23-after line 19 Insert and renumber as necessary:
"Section 3. Not later than February 1, 2026, the department of
administration and information shall report to the joint appropriations
committee on the executive branch telework policy. The report shall identify
the total number of full-time and part-time employees authorized to perform
their position responsibilities at an alternate work location during the period
beginning July 1, 2025 and ending December 31, 2025. The report shall be
organized by department and detail the total number of days employees worked at

an alternate work location during this period, including a breakdown of the
number of employees working from an out-of-state alternate work location.".
